WEBVTT

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.470
Time to move out already.

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:13.040
Yes, sir!

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.750
Do you think Kudo died?

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:26.380
I would guess that Kudo can regrow his tail.

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.720
We should take it with us, right?

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:31.880
His tail...

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:35.520
It's cold and slippery...

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:37.720
I don't hate it.

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:41.700
Hort, look.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.150
On the ground.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:45.640
These are...

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:48.400
Three sets of footprints.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.780
One is Kudo, and one is Professor Los.

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:54.030
The last one is the witch hunter.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.340
I think.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:01:00.910
But that means... there's only one enemy.

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:06.420
And yet, even with the advantage of magic,
 Kudo chose to flee rather than fight.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:10.180
It might be best to turn back.

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:12.150
This is probably a professional.

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:13.920
A professional?

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:17.040
Remember from class?

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:22.170
The former death-row inmates,
 recruited by the Church to hunt witches.

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:25.300
It's an Arbiter from Dia Ignis!

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:03.530
They'll stop at nothing to kill a witch.

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:03.530
Episode 2
Don't Call Me a Traitor

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:07.520
They don't care how many 
innocent people may die.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.670
That's how they've been trained.

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:13.340
But Dia Ignis was dismantled.

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:19.170
Just because the organization is gone 
doesn't mean the people in it went away, too!

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:20.930
Hort...

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:26.590
Damn! Where'd he go?

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:28.160
We need to find him, fast!

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:28.680
Hey!

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:31.470
Oh, right. That was close.

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:32.340
Let's go!

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:38.070
I hope those two got away safely.

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:42.700
Now, where are they hiding?

00:03:46.190 --> 00:03:47.030
Kudo.

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:48.330
They're gonna find us...

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:54.460
Small fry who can't cast 
aren't even worth protecting.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:55.460
H-Hey!

00:03:57.360 --> 00:03:59.700
Don't follow me. You're dead weight!

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:05.600
What is that rope?

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:13.310
A freaking trap?!

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:24.950
I've met one before.

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:28.150
Just once, when I was little.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:33.180
I went to a nearby village to see a friend.

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:34.580
That's when...

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:39.840
Whad'ya want? Ya got a friend in this heap?

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:45.980
If ya can't prove they're not a witch,
 I'll have to burn <i>you</i>, too.

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:51.180
I-I have no...

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:53.900
friends here!

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:57.230
I ran away.

00:04:57.660 --> 00:05:00.480
Even though my friend was killed, 
I was scared...

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:03.550
I lied to protect myself...

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:07.960
If it was an Arbiter that attacked Kudo,

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:10.740
we'll be no help whatsoever!

00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:12.350
So let's go back!

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.830
Sayb, was that...?

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:17.750
Yeah.

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:21.690
I think it'd be best to run.

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:22.630
Yeah.

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:26.100
Professor Los might get mad if we show up.

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:28.640
Th-That's true. So let's—

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:30.220
But...

00:05:30.690 --> 00:05:31.510
we have to help.

00:05:32.340 --> 00:05:32.980
What?

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:37.500
Hort, if your friend had still been alive,
 I don't think you would've run.

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:41.340
I'm sure you would've tried to 
help while holding back tears,

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:43.530
just like now.

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:45.670
Sayb...

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:56.000
Damn it!

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.330
I gotta get out of here.

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:08.210
Hell, it was just a rope.

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:12.110
So we meet again, lizard boy.

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:16.030
The Dia Ignis Arbiter!

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:19.650
The Church calls me the Tyrant.

00:06:20.010 --> 00:06:22.380
Ya fell right into 'em, huh?

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:24.400
These simple traps.

00:06:24.770 --> 00:06:26.490
Are ya scared?

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:27.650
Ya gotta be.

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:30.910
Any step could set off a trap.

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:34.160
Not knowing stops you in your tracks.

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:37.850
<i>My attack magic didn't work 
on this guy yesterday,</i>

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:40.170
<i>so I won't go on the offensive.</i>

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:44.550
You entered my hunting grounds.

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:47.180
Solm!

00:06:56.030 --> 00:07:00.690
So you can run, eh, Mr. Lizard Mage?

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:02.100
Impossible!

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:04.190
Ya know,

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:06.570
you're awfully slow!

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.420
Huh.

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:20.410
I guess being a beastfallen and a mage 
don't necessarily mean you're strong.

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:22.420
What's this?

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:24.860
The wound is closed?

00:07:26.490 --> 00:07:31.250
I bet the Church's researchers 
would love to have ya as a lab rat.

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:33.740
Hey! One of you out there!

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:35.660
Fetch me a cage!

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:41.120
<i>Why me?</i>

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:42.440
<i>Why is it always me?</i>

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:45.950
<i>After I managed to escape that place...</i>

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:48.850
<i>After I've come so far...</i>

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:51.460
<i>No.</i>

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:51.460
No.

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:53.780
<i>No! No! No!</i>

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:53.780
No! No! No!

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:02.040
Now, witness as I return his arms to normal!

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:05.830
<i>I refuse to go back to living in a cage!</i>

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:09.170
<i>I thought I'd become strong.</i>

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:11.840
<i>I thought I could protect others.</i>

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:13.680
<i>I can't even protect myself!</i>

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:17.240
I don't need an escort.

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:20.430
Listen, Kudo. The world can be harsh.

00:08:20.990 --> 00:08:25.440
But you don't have to bear 
the burden all on your own.

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:29.440
Oh? Who's gonna shoulder it for me, then?

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:31.250
Remember this:

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:36.700
As long as you are a student 
of my academy, I will not forsake you.

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:40.030
Loux Krystas is a little odd,

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:41.900
but she's a good witch.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:45.960
<i>If I'd gone with them, would I—</i>

00:08:47.010 --> 00:08:48.210
<i>Would someone have chosen...</i>

00:08:49.740 --> 00:08:51.740
<i>to protect a guy like me?</i>

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:59.430
Hey. Ain't ya heard of futile resistance?

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:02.070
Don't waste my time.

00:09:02.070 --> 00:09:02.600
Ya hear me?

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:12.110
Well? Now do you underst—

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:14.360
Hey, now.

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:16.360
Oh, screw it!

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:20.080
I'll crush your skull and 
offer 'em your corpse!

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:22.450
Hold thy horses!

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:28.170
What was that?!

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:29.460
I swear.

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:35.840
Attacking a stray duckling. 
Thou hast no shame.

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:39.820
My dear Ludens, say hello!

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:49.910
Let me guess.

00:09:49.910 --> 00:09:53.780
Thy capital crimes were pardoned 
when Dia Ignis was disbanded,

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:56.780
but with no skills but 
killing, thou wast destitute,

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:59.030
and now servest the anti-witch faction?

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:01.410
H-How come y-you're here?

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:04.410
'Tis a teacher's duty.

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:05.910
But...

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:08.530
Silence! Just stand back!

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:09.880
You...

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:13.880
That staff... Is that the Staff of Ludens?!

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.390
Indeed!

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:19.410
For <i>I</i> am the pact-holder 
of the Staff of Ludens,

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:22.400
the Dawn Witch, Loux Krystas.

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:26.640
And at the moment, I am a teacher 
to the Magic Academy's ducklings!

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:40.820
Back, murderous mad dog loosed 
from the Church's chains!

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:44.790
Damn it!

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:53.790
I-Incredible!

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:56.360
I harbor no fondness for conflict.

00:10:56.360 --> 00:10:59.120
Shouldst thou retreat now, 
I shan't take thy life.

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:02.240
Professor Los!

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:03.800
That's not good.

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:06.840
Kudo! Where are you?

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:11.850
Professor Los!

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:14.110
Why did you come? Flee!

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:19.920
Look out.

00:11:23.020 --> 00:11:24.780
Let me thank you.

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:27.290
So nice of you to show up.

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:29.440
S-Sayb!

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:30.540
Don't move!

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:44.850
I'll snap this twerp's neck!

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:48.130
Got that, escorting professor?

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:50.850
P-Professor Los.

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:54.830
What would that gain thee, Arbiter?

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:57.610
The moment you end these children's lives,

00:11:58.060 --> 00:12:01.070
thy life shall end as well.

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:06.990
This can end without all that killing. 
Throw down your staff.

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:09.120
If I can get the Staff of Ludens and

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:12.760
its pact-holder in exchange 
for letting the twerp go,

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:14.750
then that's a bargain.

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:18.710
I'm afraid I cannot afford that bargain.

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:23.370
Then we all die together!

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:33.390
Stop!

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:42.460
There. Now unhand Sayb.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.100
Are you kidding?

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:55.500
The pact-holder of the Staff of 
Ludens is playing teacher for real?

00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:59.960
Professor Los! Don't worry 
about us. Just get him!

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:00.960
Shut up!

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:04.710
Listen good, Teach. Step away from the staff.

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:08.850
Hey, stop lying there.

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:11.570
Bring me that staff!

00:13:11.570 --> 00:13:13.730
Wrap it with this.

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:15.800
B-But...

00:13:15.800 --> 00:13:18.360
It's special consecrated cloth.

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:24.050
When wrapped in it, the Staff of 
Ludens ain't nothin' but a stick.

00:13:29.630 --> 00:13:31.430
What'd I tell ya?

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:33.790
Hey, tie up Teach over there,

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:35.540
Hort.

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:42.050
C'mon, missy. No need to resist.

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:45.050
You can cut the act now.

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:47.160
Go on. Tell 'em...

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:50.430
that the Church sent 
you to the Magic Academy

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:54.430
as a spy for the anti-witch faction!

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:57.760
S-Stop!

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:01.080
<i>I was called the child of a demon.</i>

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:05.590
<i>At a young age, I suddenly 
started growing horns.</i>

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:08.060
<i>My mother told me...</i>

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:11.440
Always keep a smile on your face.

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:14.790
Then you'll be saved.

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:15.480
Okay.

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:17.960
Stop it!

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:19.580
I'm scared!

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:22.250
Help! Mommy!

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:26.420
Those horns are proof your 
soul is tainted. Hide them.

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:29.890
It's for your own good.

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:35.850
Please let my soul be cleansed.

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:38.540
I promise to never stop smiling,

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:40.850
so let no one hate me.

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:43.850
A magic academy?

00:14:43.850 --> 00:14:48.610
Yes. I want you to enroll there 
and provide us information.

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:51.260
Um, what about after graduation?

00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:53.890
You will maintain your cover as a mage.

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:58.130
Work for the Church's benefit, 
striving to never be discovered.

00:14:58.130 --> 00:14:59.710
I have great expectations.

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:00.870
Yes, sir!

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:04.880
Wow, Hort! You got the highest grades again!

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:07.870
You could be the top mage 
in the kingdom one day.

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:09.130
You're too nice.

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:11.820
What kind of job do you 
want after you graduate?

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:14.140
What? Um...

00:15:15.070 --> 00:15:16.140
Me?

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:21.140
The Magic Division of the Church & Mage 
Army wants to recruit you after graduation.

00:15:21.580 --> 00:15:24.650
Defending the kingdom is an important job.

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:29.950
Maybe I should reveal everything.

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:33.240
I want to become a mage.

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:35.410
But what do I do?

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:38.450
I really don't want to graduate.

00:15:39.380 --> 00:15:42.550
A three-year special field program?

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:43.670
What do you think?

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.360
I-I'll do it!

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:50.410
Please let me participate!

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:54.180
I was so happy.

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:57.260
I could still study magic!

00:15:57.260 --> 00:15:58.850
I'd feel like I belonged!

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:03.660
But in that moment, I had a bad feeling.

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:08.560
I didn't know a witch hunter 
from the Church would show up.

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:14.610
If something happened,
 I would have to betray everyone...

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:18.120
That's why I poisoned that skewer,

00:16:18.900 --> 00:16:22.620
so I could eat it and throw 
off our travel schedule.

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:27.750
Sayb, that's my skewer!

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:31.720
I hoped Kudo's group would get attacked.

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:35.340
I thought they'd be fine with Kudo there.

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:40.680
I never imagined an Arbiter would come...
 that the <i>Tyrant</i> would come.

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:46.060
Kudo was attacked, and even Professor 
Los and Sayb are in danger.

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:49.690
In the end, I'm a traitor.

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:53.070
I've been betraying 
everyone this whole time.

00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:55.630
It's all my fault.

00:16:58.900 --> 00:17:00.790
It's okay, Hort.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:05.090
It's not your fault.

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:08.690
<i>How can he smile?</i>

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:13.650
<i>He's not even that good at it.</i>

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:18.310
<i>Now that he knows I'm a traitor...</i>

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:24.750
Hort, if your friend had still been alive, 
I don't think you would've run.

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:29.720
<i>...he should be furious that I deceived him.</i>

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:34.780
<i>He ought...</i>

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:37.530
<i>to hate me.</i>

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:40.080
Hey. What're ya doin'?

00:17:42.430 --> 00:17:45.120
<i>I won't run anymore.</i>

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:47.260
Bag Do Glaht!

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:49.900
Kalpa fire, come forth!

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:51.420
Flare and blaze!

00:17:51.770 --> 00:17:52.600
What?!

00:17:53.220 --> 00:17:54.920
Shit. Gimme that!

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:01.730
Chapter of Hunting,

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:03.010
final verse!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:04.490
Flagis!

00:18:04.490 --> 00:18:05.980
My name is Hort!

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:17.590
Hey, now, missy.

00:18:17.590 --> 00:18:19.530
What was that?

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:21.280
N-No way!

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:23.600
A betrayal?

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:26.690
That's the child of a demon for ya.

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:33.630
<i>The Staff of Ludens...</i>

00:18:35.100 --> 00:18:37.460
If ya ain't gonna be useful,

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:39.590
then die!

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:44.840
Use me.

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:52.410
No, Sayb! Don't touch it!

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:54.820
I'm sorry, Professor Los.

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:57.850
For being dead weight.

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:07.540
What the hell is this?

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:10.790
Ludens, no!

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:14.500
Release that boy!

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:17.510
What's going on?

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:20.260
S-Sayb!

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:23.760
Sayb!

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:48.360
Sayb!

00:19:48.360 --> 00:19:49.540
You're alive!

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:53.540
Thank goodness! You're alive!

00:19:54.770 --> 00:19:57.040
Huh? We're all alive...

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:59.510
And what is that supposed to mean, pray tell?

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:02.260
Thou fool!

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:05.260
Using the witch-eating staff is suicide!

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:11.170
If thou needest someone to be dead to 
learn thy lesson, I can kill someone now.

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:13.390
Will that bring thee to thy senses?

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:18.400
Each and every one of you, 
foolhardy! Foolhardy! Foolhardy!

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:21.460
I wasn't that reckless, though.

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:22.200
Excuse me?

00:20:23.300 --> 00:20:26.090
Thy overweening refusal of mine escort

00:20:26.090 --> 00:20:29.380
is what got us into this 
mess in the first place!

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:31.040
F-Face too close!

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:32.790
Professor, calm dow—

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:37.760
To be honest, Hort, I never 
imagined thou couldst track me.

00:20:37.760 --> 00:20:41.050
The greater the talent, 
the greater the burden of its misuse!

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:43.300
Professor, you're too close!

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:47.170
I did not forget about <i>thee</i>, Ludens!

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:52.260
How darest thou make eyes at Sayb 
despite having me as your pact-holder!

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:56.020
<b>I'm sorry</b>

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:56.020
I sentence thee to a day of being sealed.

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:02.220
Professor Los,

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:05.780
how can it be that I am alive?

00:21:06.550 --> 00:21:12.790
Thy magic exceeded what my 
dear Ludens could siphon away.

00:21:15.020 --> 00:21:16.420
His magic was...

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:18.290
...too great for the staff?!

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:22.140
Sayb's magic is evidently infinite.

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:25.290
No wonder thou struggle 
to control thy spells.

00:21:25.290 --> 00:21:26.300
Honestly.

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:31.310
My dear Ludens had solely expended 
magic these past 300 years.

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:33.830
Now his belly is full again.

00:21:35.470 --> 00:21:39.350
When will my life come to an end now?

00:21:40.430 --> 00:21:44.070
Anyway. Kudo, thou wilt come with us.

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:46.650
Huh? No, I'll be fine on my own.

00:21:47.550 --> 00:21:49.310
What was that?

00:21:49.310 --> 00:21:51.580
Ah! Your face is too close!

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:54.170
Fine! I'll come with you!

00:21:55.430 --> 00:21:56.580
Much better.

00:21:57.160 --> 00:21:58.260
Damn it.

00:21:58.260 --> 00:22:01.790
Guess I better go grab 
my tail and reattach it.

00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:05.040
What is it?

00:22:05.040 --> 00:22:07.050
Um, well...

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:13.060
Sorry. I used your tail as a spell offering.

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:18.650
You <i>what</i>?!

00:22:19.410 --> 00:22:20.280
My bad.

00:22:20.280 --> 00:22:22.060
Y-You got some nerve...!

00:22:22.060 --> 00:22:25.070
Oh, come on! Get along, you two!

00:23:56.620 --> 00:23:59.130
'Tis good that everyone is unharmed.

00:23:57.790 --> 00:24:10.050
<b>Next Episode          "Beyond the Steam"</b>

00:23:59.130 --> 00:24:01.800
Unharmed?! Look at my hands and my tail!

00:24:01.800 --> 00:24:04.790
Who shall lose parts next time? 
And which ones?

00:24:04.790 --> 00:24:07.210
Next Episode: "Beyond the Steam."

00:24:07.210 --> 00:24:10.050
A hot spring episode?!
